# The debris sprite pack is licensed for use, NOT for redistribution:
#   "You're free to use these assets in personal or commercial projects without restrictions."
#   "You may not resell or redistribute the asset."
#           — RehanDev, 300+ Asteroid and Space Junk Pixel
#
# So no art of any kind is published here, and that is enforced rather than remembered.
# The pipeline runs without it: `--stub` replays a recorded run with no assets present.
assets/
art/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.aseprite

# Node, if anyone adds tooling later. The pipeline itself has zero dependencies.
node_modules/

# Per-agent prompts and replies from the last run. Regenerated in about a second by
# `node run-content.js --stub`, and the recorded replies they come from are tracked in
# content/stubs/ — so nothing is lost. Not published because a retry prompt quotes the
# absolute path of whatever machine produced the fixtures.
content/out/logs/
